{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46950","headline":"寄韩蜕秀才 · 齐己","name":"寄韩蜕秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松门高不似侯门，藓迳鞋踪触处分。\n远事即爲无害鸟，多闲便是有情云。\n那忧宠辱来惊我，且寄风骚去敌君。\n[知]伴李膺琴酒外，绦纱闲卷共论文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}